        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Toyota pickup truck, Toyota Hilux\n- Companies: Toyota\n- Programs: IMV program\n- Places: North America, Tahara\n- Topics: Toyota War naming\n\nFacts:\n- The Toyota War is primarily named after a Toyota pickup truck.\n- Toyota retired the name of that pickup truck in North America in 1976.\n- The pickup truck is the Toyota Hilux.\n- Toyota includes the Toyota Hilux in its IMV program with Tahara.",
